      "objective": "Set an extension ladder at a safe angle and footing.",
      "initial_test": "Look at the ground and the wall contact point.",
      "exit_predicate": "The base is 1 ft out for every 4 ft of height, the feet sit level and firm, locks are engaged, and the rails bear evenly.",
